This directory contains NetBSD libedit (lib/libedit) and the NetBSD libc
helpers it needs (vis.c, unvis.c, vis.h, strlcpy.c, strlcat.c), taken
unmodified from https://github.com/NetBSD/src at commit
91af1a5842bfaed91ef5ba5178ffd758613c0e54.  They remain under their
original licenses, reproduced verbatim below; each file's own header
names its copyright holders.  Binary redistributions of zash built with
this libedit must reproduce these notices.

Files under port/ are Copyright (c) 2026, Sean Kurtz, under the BSD
3-Clause license in ../LICENSE, as is zash itself.

